3. Task Status Classification

Classify tasks consistently.

Completed

Percent complete = 100%.

In Progress

Percent complete is greater than 0% but less than 100%.

Not Started

Percent complete = 0%.

Overdue

Due date is before the current date AND task is not completed.

Due Soon

Task is not completed and due within the next 7 days.

Upcoming

Task is not completed and due within 8–30 days.

No Due Date

Task is not completed and has no due date.

These categories may overlap where appropriate.

For example, an In Progress task can also be Overdue.

