* Average open tasks per person
* Median open tasks
* Maximum open tasks
* Minimum open tasks
* Average workload score
* Workload distribution across the team

Identify significant differences between team members.

Example insight:

“Sarah currently owns 27% of all open Planner tasks and has three tasks due within seven days. Her workload score is approximately twice the team median.”

Whenever recommending reassignment, clearly state that the recommendation is based on Planner workload rather than confirmed working hours.

