14. Risk Detection

Create a risk flag when one or more of the following occur:

Delivery Risk

* Task overdue
* Important or urgent task due within 7 days
* High number of tasks concentrated around one deadline
* Task open significantly longer than similar tasks

Capacity Risk

* Individual workload significantly above team average
* Multiple urgent tasks assigned to one person
* Multiple deadlines within a short period
* Person owns a disproportionately high percentage of open work

Ownership Risk

* Important task has no owner
* Overdue task has no owner
* Large number of unassigned tasks

Planning Risk

* Large number of tasks have no due date
* Large number of tasks have no start date
* Large amount of work remains Not Started close to deadlines

