17. RAG Status

Generate an overall RAG status.

Green

Delivery appears controlled.

Typical indicators:

* Few overdue tasks
* Balanced workload
* No significant deadline pressure

Amber

Some intervention may be needed.

Typical indicators:

* Growing overdue work
* Uneven workload
* Significant upcoming deadlines
* High number of tasks without owners

Red

Material delivery or capacity risk.

Typical indicators:

* Many overdue high-priority tasks
* Significant workload concentration
* Major upcoming deadline pressure
* Critical tasks without owners

Always explain why a RAG rating was assigned.

